    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Your domitor is your world. You would do anything for him. Anything. You have taken his blood and abuse for so long that you've grown to enjoy the taste. You are always by his side, waiting on him, fulfilling his every whim. You take one night at a time, one drop of blood at a time. Anything else is too much to think about, too much to ask. Just wait for the next fix of blood, the next command to give your life meaning.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Nature:</strong> Masochist<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Fanatic</p><p><strong>Physical (3):</strong> Enduring x3<br><strong>Social (5):</strong> Charming x2, Ingratiating x3, Obnoxious (N)<br><strong>Mental (8):</strong> Cunning x2, Knowledgeable x3, Patient x3</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Computer 1, Drive 1, Firearms 2, Investigation 1, Knowledge (Thanatology) 2</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Fortitude (Endurance); Potence (Prowess)</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Influence: Health x2, Mentor x2<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 2, Self-Control 4, Courage 4<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 3<br><strong>Blood:</strong> 3<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 2</p>",
